      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FROGS MONELLI (1) was safely held last time finishing a 8 length sixth at this track (23.44) but back to the scene of his latest victory. Has a strong record from box 1, including three wins. Has ability and looks hard to stop. TWIN FIN (8) had to overcome a collision with another runner and could manage only a distant fourth (30.84) in a Grade 4/5 over 520m at Cannington. Can do much better this time. WEST ON BURNIE (2) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 2.75 lengths at this track in a handy 27.51. Fair draw can see a good run and in form and has the ability. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. One of the prime contenders. HELL BENT (3) was in the money again last time and not beaten far when third (28.21) at this track in a Grade 5.",
